Hi Alex,

Thank you for today's call. The online menu with Dojo's hosted checkout is re=
ady for Pontardawe RFC at https://menu.pontardawerfc.com/ : guests order at t=
heir table and pay on Dojo's secure page, and the order reaches the till alre=
ady paid.

It works end to end on our sandbox account. On Pontardawe's live account, tho=
ugh, Dojo refuses the payment intent with:

  403 "Your api key for account acc_oyRNdfHOu0ORmqQq_uV2lw is not enabled for=
 Remote Payments."

Could you please enable:
1. Remote Payments (online checkout on pay.dojo.tech, card not present) on th=
e account
2. Apple Pay and Google Pay on that checkout
3. Refunds through the API, so the till and kitchen screen can refund a cance=
lled order
4. The same for the Vesopa Software Ltd product, so every venue on Vesopa can=
 switch it on

Account: Pontardawe RUGBY Football Club Limited
Location: Pontardawe Rugby Club
Account id: acc_oyRNdfHOu0ORmqQq_uV2lw
API key: ag_DXWGB2Zj6... (product: Vesopa Software Ltd), live
Website: menu.pontardawerfc.com

A QUICK CALL TOMORROW?
Vesopa =C3=97 Dojo: Remote Payments for Pontardawe RFC
Friday 16 October 2026, 10am to 10:30am UK time (BST)
Google Meet link to follow, or by phone.
The calendar invite is attached, so you can accept or decline it from your in=
box. If another time is better, just reply with it, or if it is easier to swi=
tch it on without a call, that is perfect too.

Once Remote Payments is on, we will run one small live payment and refund it =
